  "Authors@R": "c(\nperson(\"Thomas\", \"Girke\", email=\"thomas.girke@ucr.edu\", role=c(\"cre\", \"aut\"), comment=c(ORCID=\"0000-0003-0710-3777\")),\nperson(\"Kevin\", \"Horan\", role=\"ctb\"))",
  "Description": "Utilities for identifying known drug-target interactions\nfor sets of query drug and/or target protein (gene)\nidentifiers. The interaction information is obtained from a\nseries of drug and target databases, including ChEMBL, PubChem,\nDGIdb, Open Targets, the Therapeutic Target Database, the Broad\nInstitute Drug Repurposing Hub and the IUPHAR/BPS Guide to\nPHARMACOLOGY. Each source can be queried on its own, or several\nof them combined into a single table anchored on HGNC gene\nidentifiers. Identifier translation utilities map query\nidentifiers onto the native identifier types each source\nexpects.",
  "VignetteBuilder": "knitr",
